      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: But there is no new UI yet. If it was implemented into the config asap and then integrated into the new UI when it does come out, that alone could help prevent so many crashes by malicious users. Having any sort of protection other than safety to not even show avatars would be nice.",
