      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fa82794131f81609b05d8a6|full_name}: you have good intentions but I would rather they spend the time putting it into the new UI so that it doesn’t sit in the config file for years and need a full game restart to change the settings. Never ask for something to be put into the config file is the lesson here unless it can be useful for something game breaking immediately. We can wait a little bit more for the UI release.\nBased on the last update we got they have enough of the new UI to have sorted out the setting menu by now. Or all their talk on being able to expand it for new features should allow an advanced settings menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
