  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-23T23:23:30.532Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We already have a particle limiter, but what about other things that can cause crashes? Mesh particles limit, mesh limit, material limits. Things like this would be great to also have in our configs.",
